## 13. Recognition and AI Integration

Create an abstraction between NestJS and the Python AI service.

The NestJS backend must not implement the machine-learning model directly.

The AI service must expose its own documented API.

Use a configurable provider:

- `mock`
- `pretrained`
- `finetuned`

The mock provider is for testing and local development only. Identify mock output clearly.

Never return fake text as a real model prediction.

### Recognition endpoints

Implement:

- `POST /api/v1/pages/:id/recognition-jobs`
